/-!
# Uniform Static Exponential Schedules

This module selects the polynomial and phase schedules for a static exponential LCU before
choosing the Hermitian matrices or their oracle. `originalA_static_uniform_outer` depends on the
frame, scale bounds, time, accuracy, sample parameters, and coefficients, and then works for
every compatible exact encoding of `L + Complex.I • H`.

The resulting `originalStaticOuterWord` encodes the weighted sum of the evolutions generated by
`H + s j • L`. The theorem also supplies unit-modulus phases, branch lengths, circuit
well-formedness, and the same `dyadicOrder` query bound as the nonuniform consumer interface.
See [WangEtAl2026].

## Main statements

* `originalA_static_uniform_outer` constructs a single schedule valid for all compatible `L`,
  `H`, and `U`.
* Its block encoding has scale `4 * coefficientMass c` and error `ε * coefficientMass c`.

## References

* [Wang et al., 2026][WangEtAl2026]
-/

